<title>USA: Motorola PCS series of StarTAC phone.</title>
<headline>Motorola PCS series of StarTAC phone.</headline>
<dateline>LIBERTYVILLE, Ill. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Motorola Inc said Thursday its StarTAC wearable phone is now available for use with digital Personal Communications Services (PCS) wireless phone networks.</p>
<p>The StarTAC GSM 1900 series of phones is designed for the North American market, the company said.</p>
<p>Motorola provides wireless communications, semiconductors, and advanced electronic systems and services.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
